  {
    "type": "effect_on_condition",
    "id": "EOC_BERSERK_READ_HUNT_WARNING",
    "effect": {
      "u_message": "Its lunges cross only a short gap. The wounded prey escaped by widening the distance; the apostle could not restore its torn flesh. Clear the two scavengers, keep the return track open, and draw it around the stone screens. You need preparation, not Flora's armor or perfect health.",
      "type": "info",
      "popup": true
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "effect_on_condition",
    "id": "EOC_BERSERK_READ_HUNT_VICTIMS",
    "effect": {
      "u_message": "The belongings do not match: a carter's knot, a traveler's patched shirt, a little cord tied as a charm. This predator took people one by one, not as part of a ceremony. Drag marks lead from the ruined stopping place into the hollow.",
      "type": "info",
      "popup": true
    }
  },
  {
    "type": "effect_on_condition",
    "id": "EOC_BERSERK_READ_BREACH_FAILED_LINE",
    "effect": {
      "u_message": "The old road ran past a small watch post. Someone ringed the crack with stakes and cloth wards; the ground tore through the foundations instead. Three firm patches remain. The open middle is short, while the western remains of the wall provide a covered approach.",
      "type": "info",
      "popup": true
    }
  },
